[Music]  a few days ago top gun maverick the late  sequel to the classic film top gun was  finally released in cinemas after almost  36 years following a total of five  postponements of the release date the  blockbuster was a huge success at the  box office which must have come as a  surprise to some people in fact top gun  maverick even bad pirates of the  caribbean at worlds and as the most  successful film ever released in the us  over the memorial day weekend critics  and fans are also showering the movie  with praise which is why the question of  another sequel is slowly but surely  being raised producer jerry bruckheimer  who was already involved in the first  movie in the same position recently  spoke to deadline about plans for a  potential top count 3. according to the  report there were no immediate plans for  third film but they would continue to  ride the wave of success so given the  gigantic hit it is almost safe to assume  that we will see maverick at his  favorite adrenaline fuel activity once  more we can only hope that this time it  won't take another 36 years  it is almost unthinkable that just a few  years ago there was talk of an indiana  jones film without harrison ford after  all kinds of problems such as a shoulder  injury of the 79 year old leading actor  fans are now even more pleased that  director james mangal published their  first image it shows indiana jones  himself in a dark cave walking across a  bridge in dim light at first sight you  can hardly see any difference to earlier  movies even if harrison ford and thus  his film character indiana jones have  aged noticeably ford also talked about  the movie in the course of a surprise  appearance at the star wars celebration  he said he was very proud of the new  installment and held out the prospect of  wrapping up filming in the near future  he also spoke highly of the  participation of kathleen kennedy and  james mangle both of whom he said he had  a wonderful experience with coaster mats  mickelson was also full of praise for  harrison ford who is said to have given  his superb performance at nearly 80  years of age aside from that we can  expect a true old school movie we're  looking forward to the upcoming indiana  jones 5 which will be released on june  30th 2023  after a long waiting period the third  season of the mandalorian will finally  be released on disney plus in february  2023 as producer jen favreau announced  at the star wars celebration this series  is complete and currently in  post-production while his colleague dave  filoni keeps working on ahsoka favreau  himself is already slowly but surely  devoting himself to the fourth season of  the mandalorian in the newly shown  trailer we see the armor as well as the  helmetless mandalorian who's about to  clear his name the latter eventually  travels to mandalore along with grogu  where he is greeted by the heiress bo  katan whether she will end up helping  him in his endeavor or what else  mandalore has to offer is sadly left  unknown either way din jardin will have  to face moff gideon again as you can  suspect from the star destroyer shown in  the trailer in addition to the ongoing  series lead actor pedro pascal talked  about further plans for the mandalorian  in an interview with variety this  included the fact that pascal's big  dream would be to play the mandalorian  not only on disney plus but also on the  big screen in the future however he did  emphasize that this is only a dream of  his and that to his knowledge a movie is  not officially being planned he would  nonetheless be happy about the  mandalorian cinematic experience  sometime in the future we are excited to  find out what will happen next with the  mandalorian it is at least certain that  the third season will be released on  disney plus on february 23rd 2023  last week the star wars celebration was  held in anaheim california the now 14th  edition of the world's largest star wars  fan gathering was actually supposed to  take place in 2020 but was then  postponed due to the pandemic among the  countless announcements was the new  tales of the jedi series which had long  been the subject of many rumors for  several weeks now more precise  information is available it is known  already that a total of six episodes  will be produced likewise revealed are a  couple of featured characters among them  are count doku meswindu ahsoka anakin  skywalker and qui-gon jin the latter was  played by liam neeson in episode 1 and  as we are now aware he will also be  dubbing the jedi master the series is  conceived as an anthology this means  that we will see the aforementioned jedi  in a variety of stories that are not  necessarily related with three episodes  each the focus will be on a sokatanu on  the one side and count doku on the other  especially the doku episodes are  expected to be quite intense since they  will deal with a bloody development of  the former jedi master into a disciple  of dobbed sidious at least that's what  lucasfilm executive producer dave filoni  implied plus the three episodes with  ahsoka at the center will cover almost  her entire life visitors to the star  wars celebration got their first sneak  peek as lucasfilm screened the very  first episode where ahsoka is still a  baby besides all the information at the  first episode there was also a first  trailer to the delight of many fans one  character is still a mystery because  according to eyewitness reports somebody  can be seen from behind in one of the  scenes which is probably yellow based on  the long hair anyways we are eager for  more news and are really looking forward  to tales of the jedi as the series is  scheduled to be released on disney plus  this fall  between 2012 and 2015 lionsgate achieved  great success with a four-part film  series the hunger games this was  followed last year by the announcement  of a prequel titled the hunger games the  ballot of songbirds and snakes while the  original four movies were based on the  first three volumes of susan collins  novels the upcoming movie built on the  fourth volume which was also released as  a prequel in may 2020 so far it was  known that newcomer tom blyth will play  the infamous villain coriolis snow now  the people in charge also seem to have  found a female leading actress the tank  is of 21 year old rachel zegler who is  best known for her golden globe  award-winning role as maria vazquez in  west side story she stars as lucy gray  baird from district 12 who ends up as a  tribute in the 10th hunger games her  mentor is the aforementioned cory lannis  who seems extremely skeptical at first  but is then won over by lucy's iron will  it'll definitely be interesting to see  how well the ballad of songbirds and  snakes will be received by audiences  after a gap of quite a few years the  release date is set for november 17 2023  sonic the hedgehog 2 is currently still  running in many movie theaters and is  regarded as an acceptable but also not  overly great sequel with worldwide  revenues of around 385 million us  dollars the box office takings are  nevertheless positive and there already  seem to be plans for a third part this  was recently revealed by the two  screenwriters pat casey and josh miller  in a q a session there they spoke about  the fact that they are still in a very  early stage of production not really  knowing which direction they will go  with another sequel the focus of  attention is currently the search of a  voice actor for the character that was  teased and at the end of sonic the  hedgehog 2. it's expected to be a high  profile hollywood star as was the case  with knuckles and idris elba more  details are not known so far at present  those responsible are aiming for release  date in 2024 but we will of course keep  you up to date with further information  playstation fans will hardly have failed  to notice the release of horizon  forbidden west earlier this year the  sequel to horizon zero dawn which was  released in 2017 met just about all of  the fans expectations the story of both  the games takes place about 1 000 years  in the future and deals with the past  downfall of human civilization as we  know it those who are still alive join  together in comparatively small tribes  to stand their ground against the enemy  the foe consists of gigantic machinery  that has largely wiped out mankind and  is very reminiscent of prehistoric  dinosaurs the plot centers around young  ally who not only has to deal with the  machines but also resolve old enmities  between the tribes apart from the  storyline around alloy's personal  history the huge and jaw-dropping world  stands out in both video games as  comicbook.com reports netflix recently  secured the rights for a serious  adaption however it is still unclear in  what direction the series will go in  other words whether it will be strongly  based on the original game or whether it  will pursue a completely different  approach in the existing world in terms  of game adaptions it won't stop at a  horizon zero dawn series because a gran  turismo movie is also in the works sony  announced this at its recent 2022  business segment briefings at the  present time it seems to be the heyday  of video game adaptions anyway as we can  still look forward to the last of us  twisted metal and the recently announced  god of war series by amazon as well as  the movie adaption of ghost of tsushima  that's plenty of content for the tv  screen in our opinion which adaption are  you most excited for and can you think  of any other movie and serious adaptions  of games that haven't been announced yet  feel welcome to let us know in the  comments  that's it for the latest news from the  world of series and films if you haven't  seen the new pinocchio trailer with dom  hangs this week we strongly suggest to  do so apart from that you can find  another movie preview on a channel and  this time the focus is on ant-man and  the wasp quantum mania afterwards you  will definitely know about all the new  developments of the mcu movie  [Music]  you

